  "scope": "Honest prompt-fold Qwen8 and refitted original 54-feature GLM head. External 54/216 use original dual Qwen with the actually measured pair of GLM likelihoods on all candidates. Fit style only on official data. Target mixture, full V30 trunk and hidden result are unknown. The small external cohorts overlap SVC4 training and are component comparisons. The two small-batch proxy arms explicitly turn off the production gate of 50 eligible rows. Raw Qwen score normalization can shift each row by a constant, which does not affect any compared ranking, log-odds or final label.",
  "recipe": "Original 54-feature, legacy routing. The published Fable recipe changes capped Fable priority, retention for the Fable class and typography penalty. Bill changes GLM weight, and combined_exploration applies the two authors' changes together without any parameter search.",
